@base = http://127.0.0.1:8102
@ownerPassword = REPLACE_LOCALLY_FROM_IGNORED_CREDENTIALS
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOGIN_TOKEN_LOCALLY

### Read the machine-readable contract
GET {{base}}/openapi.json

### Login returns a token once
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@accesspolicy.test","password":"{{ownerPassword}}"}

### Own organization list
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orgs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Use organization and user IDs from the actual list, not another tenant
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orgs/1/members?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modify the synthetic member; read its current version first
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/orgs/1/members/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"viewer","expectedVersion":1}

### Logout invalidates the current token
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
